      "h2": "Pomodoro method",
      "body_html": "<p class=\"big\">The <span class=\"hl p\">Pomodoro</span> technique: 25 minutes of focus, then a 5 minute break.</p><p>After 4 rounds, take a 15–30 minute break. 🍅</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 2",
      "h2": "Sort the environment",
      "body_html": "<p>Small things make a big difference:</p><ul><li>Quiet room, tidy desk.</li><li>Phone in another room (not just on silent).</li><li>One tab on the browser.</li><li>Water and snack ready.</li></ul>"
    },
